  "notes": "Godan verb ({五段動詞|ごだんどうし}), う-ending.\n- Negative: {祓|はら}わない\n- Polite: {祓|はら}います\n- Te-form: {祓|はら}って\n- Past: {祓|はら}った\n\nUSAGE:\nDistinct from the homophone {払|はら}う (to pay; to sweep away). {祓|はら}う is specifically religious/ritual purification. The related noun {祓|はら}い or お{祓|はら}い refers to the purification ceremony itself.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {悪霊|あくりょう}を{祓|はら}う: to exorcise evil spirits\n- {穢|けが}れを{祓|はら}う: to cleanse impurity\n- {厄|やく}を{祓|はら}う: to ward off bad luck\n- お{祓|はら}いを{受|う}ける: to receive a purification ceremony",
